abstract: "Generative AI is transforming the way we work and create. This training is designed to strengthen your AI literacy, helping you use tools like Copilot and other LLM-based chatbots confidently and responsibly in a professional setting.Through interactive discussions and practical exercises, you will explore the main strengths, limitations, and best practices for working with generative AI. You will also learn effective prompting techniques to make these tools support tasks such as brainstorming, adapting tone and style, drafting content, and creating visual ideas. The session highlights ethical considerations, including ownership, copyright, and bias, to ensure accurate and responsible use of AI technologies."
